156/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 2484, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1928, "last_played": 1730680436, "avatar": "878fa8ce19bb1d8aab510c624169e0d18a609271"}, "language": "english", "review": "The game is awesome but almost no content. You have the main story that take like 5-6 hours. And after that you have 7 missions you will play over and over again. \nThe harder difficulty you choose should make tha maps longer and harder. But everything is the same except more/harder enemies. So it will get repetitive fast.\n\nThey need to add a lot more variation in PVE for this game to be worth 60 euro. And this should be in the game day 1 and not in 6 month when 95% dont play it anymore.\n\nShould be more than just the regular missions to play. But if you are a fan of 40k you should buy it immediately.", "timestamp_created": 1729724427, "timestamp_updated": 1729724427, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.482315123081207275", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "177611733", "author": {"steamid": "76561199188396895", "personaname": "Kitsune", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/therealkitsune/", "num_games_owned": 86, "num_reviews": 16, "playtime_forever": 788, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 90, "playtime_at_review": 788, "deck_playtime_at_review": 8, "last_played": 1788201046, "avatar": "30448d376a01a21ad10bc247968cafffce2605a6"}, "language": "english", "review": "frequent crashes on linux with new update. really hope this changes because it is a very cool game", "timestamp_created": 1729723817, "timestamp_updated": 1788201090, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "re